---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Skill Foundry | Practical AI Skills" description="Learn what Skill Foundry is and how its practical AI resources are designed.">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SKILL FOUNDRY</p>
      <h1>Learn AI by building.</h1>
      <p>Skill Foundry is a practical learning library for people who want useful AI skills, prompts and workflows without unnecessary complexity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow article-content">
      <h2>What Skill Foundry is for</h2>
      <p>AI is changing quickly. The goal here is not to collect every new tool or trend, but to turn useful ideas into practical resources that people can understand and actually use.</p>
      <p>Each resource is designed around a simple path: discover a useful idea, understand the workflow, watch it in action, copy the prompt and adapt it to your own project.</p>

      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <p>Expect practical prompts, AI workflows, tutorials and step-by-step learning resources across creative work, productivity, automation and other useful AI applications.</p>

      <h2>Built to grow with you</h2>
      <p>Every resource has its own shareable URL so it can be opened directly from social media or discovered through search. The library will grow over time as new resources are published.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Explore the resource library →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
